          "jcr:created": "Wed Dec 27 2023 00:57:23 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Infinity</span></span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><sup><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">®</span></sup></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><br>\n <span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Total Ankle Replacement</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\nThe <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Infinity</span></span></span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><sup><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">®</span></sup></span></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"> Total Ankle System</span></span> consists of a low-profile pegged Titanium Alloy tibial tray and a flat or chamfer cut Cobalt Chrome talar dome. In addition, Infinity offers an Adaptis 3D-printed option. All components are available in a range of sizes to better match the patient’s anatomy.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The leading choice of surgeons in the US &amp; UK for Total Ankle Replacement.<sup>4,5</sup></span></span></p>\n",
